                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00462/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00375/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一套羽毛球拍，当有人使用其任意一把时所有对方的发球都使使用者无法击中羽毛球。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/4/1<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一家羽毛球馆。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被陈列于Site-CN-12的低价值物品保存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>nmd，哪个[数据删除]的在我和 ██站友谊赛的时候换成这玩意的？</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00375" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00375" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00375-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nirvana073" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6031220); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6031220&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605794646" alt="nirvana073" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6031220)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nirvana073" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6031220); return false;">nirvana073</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598089783 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Aug 2020 09:49</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00319/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台电影院用投影仪。在使用时会自动将恐怖片和动漫片、喜剧片和纪录片、科幻片和魔幻片交换。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>█达电影院的一间放映室内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">被放置于基金会员工休息区</span> 收容于Site-CN-09的标准异常物品收容柜里。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong> 为什么会有人把这玩意放在员工休息区里！——Noah特工<br />
Noah看上去吓得不轻，他本打算用它追动漫来着。——Jacob特工</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00319" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00319" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00319-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lanperouge" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6332347); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6332347&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605794646" alt="lanperouge" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6332347)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lanperouge" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6332347); return false;">lanperouge</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1594918263 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Jul 2020 16:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00121/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶洗面奶，瓶身上写着：“让你的皮肤光洁无暇！”使用其内容物涂抹于人体表面后，涂抹过的区域将会有类似玻璃的性质，内容物似乎是无限的，瓶盖无法被拧开。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong> ███市一普通市民家中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于低危异常物品收容柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>至少上面的标语没写错，不是吗？——Dr.pigeon</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00121" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00121" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00121-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605794646" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587966405 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">27 Apr 2020 05:46</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00334/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台████牌电扇，在其被开启后，（与是否接通电源无关）会使其作用范围内的物品吸附至其他物体上或对另一物体产生排斥现象，两者概率均为50%。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82Dr.Tian的办公室内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Site-CN-82中价值物品仓库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>搞不懂主管为什么要把这玩意放到中价值物品仓库……还有谁能把开关关一下？</em>-被贴在墙上的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>我是不是应该拉一下收容失效警报？</em>-对Dr.Leo产生排斥而无法关掉开关的<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">保安</span> 特工赵</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00334" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00334" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00334-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605794646" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1595921282 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Jul 2020 07:28</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一件男士休闲衬衫。<br />
<span style="color: #bb0000">A.展开更多</span> <span style="color: #bb0000">B.展开更多</span>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.展开更多</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目具有认知危害和信息危害，人类将项目穿上、认知项目以及描述项目的行为均会使自身受到精神影响，具体表现为在需要做出有3个以上选项的抉择时，将会明显地倾向于选择第3个选项。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>被Dr.Coldmist于██服饰店以£9.15的价格购得。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██低价值物品收容柜。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00374" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00374-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6439634&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605794646" alt="Coldmist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6439634)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;">Coldmist</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598068525 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Aug 2020 03:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


